{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Hey John, I'm doing ok - hope you are too. Some interesting stuff has been going on; last week I dropped off that stuff I baked at the homeless shelter. It was great and I'm more motivated than ever to help people."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_26-724bc0a1c12acd4154bb0e0b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:34:02.481225+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "724bc0a1c12acd4154bb0e0b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "724bc0a1c12acd4154bb0e0b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Hey Maria, that's awesome! I'm really inspired by your drive to make a difference. You mentioned your work at the homeless shelter last time and it made me think of how I could help too, so I just joined a fire-fighting brigade. It's such a great feeling to do something to give back to my community!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_26-4d83cd8b329b19f703ae13ee", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:34:02.511535+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4d83cd8b329b19f703ae13ee", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4d83cd8b329b19f703ae13ee", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Wow John, joining the fire brigade? That's great! How's it been so far?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_26-f74dd5592fcfa631b36c641a", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:34:02.545045+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f74dd5592fcfa631b36c641a", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f74dd5592fcfa631b36c641a", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Thanks, Maria! It's been tough, but really rewarding. The training was intense and taxing, but it changed my view on helping others. Last Sunday we had our first call-out, and it was intense. We responded to a situation and our team worked together to help those in need. Seeing their relief was awesome."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_26-0313d058aac4e33c416399a0", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:34:02.572286+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0313d058aac4e33c416399a0", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0313d058aac4e33c416399a0", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Wow, John! What was it like being part of that rescue mission?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_26-d0cf609f85a141371a55e1e0", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:34:02.605795+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d0cf609f85a141371a55e1e0", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d0cf609f85a141371a55e1e0", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: It was chaotic when we arrived, but we pulled together. I got a surge of energy and purpose, and we were able to save a family from a burning building. It was wild, but knowing we made a difference made it worth it."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_26-beb8621adb8b75bfd44d7754", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:34:02.626940+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "beb8621adb8b75bfd44d7754", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "beb8621adb8b75bfd44d7754", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Wow John, that's intense! Helping out like that takes guts - it's inspiring to hear about the difference you made."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_26-639fbde93012e9de49e76b4a", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:34:02.650634+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "639fbde93012e9de49e76b4a", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "639fbde93012e9de49e76b4a", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Thanks, Maria! It was an adrenaline rush, and I couldn't have done it without them. We trust and rely on one another, and it's great to know that we have each other's backs. They've become like family to me."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_26-4c8cd08473610e8220653ec1", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:34:02.670886+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4c8cd08473610e8220653ec1", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4c8cd08473610e8220653ec1", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Sounds great, John! It must feel incredible to have a supportive team like that."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_26-9e8aff7fac8278c9feab062c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:34:02.693028+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9e8aff7fac8278c9feab062c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9e8aff7fac8278c9feab062c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Yeah, it really does feel helpful, Maria. We have different skills and talents, but they all contribute to serving and protecting our community. And it's a bond I haven't felt since my time in the military."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_26-b52cab6bd105d36b6b8a1871", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:34:02.710036+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b52cab6bd105d36b6b8a1871", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b52cab6bd105d36b6b8a1871", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Glad you've found that same strong bond. Having friends you can rely on makes a huge difference."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_26-a52c0d020a3839a48c2308e4", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:34:02.735287+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a52c0d020a3839a48c2308e4", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a52c0d020a3839a48c2308e4", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Yeah, Maria! It's nice to know we're all in this together, striving to keep our community safe. I find it fulfilling and meaningful."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_26-1ed41a5d42bbe43d1dc901d5", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:34:02.756991+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "1ed41a5d42bbe43d1dc901d5", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "1ed41a5d42bbe43d1dc901d5", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Yeah John! It feels great to help people, and you're so awesome for it! Here's a shot I got when I volunteered. Reminds me being kind matters!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_26-9a901e84a9bbe45c97abf51a", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:34:02.779387+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9a901e84a9bbe45c97abf51a", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9a901e84a9bbe45c97abf51a", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: That's a cool photo, Maria! Small acts like that can really make a difference. Keep it up!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_26-ccfc0463586e726a1e22798e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:34:02.806862+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ccfc0463586e726a1e22798e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ccfc0463586e726a1e22798e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Thanks, John! I totally agree, so I'm gonna keep it up."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_26-abf2b34e6c338248b9f7d64e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:34:02.831862+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "abf2b34e6c338248b9f7d64e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "abf2b34e6c338248b9f7d64e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Way to go, Maria! Keep on being positive and making a difference. You're doing great!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_26-b215e80736ec98f3f88ccdc1", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:34:02.855253+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b215e80736ec98f3f88ccdc1", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b215e80736ec98f3f88ccdc1", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Thanks John! Your support means a lot to me. I'll definitely keep on going. Talk to you soon!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_26-6a24c61e77a5cff1c91537b9", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:34:02.880954+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "6a24c61e77a5cff1c91537b9", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "6a24c61e77a5cff1c91537b9", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
